ori=src('print_excerpt','Benedict Anderson, “The Origins of National Consciousness,” Verso primary excerpt from Imagined Communities.','https://www.versobooks.com/blogs/news/4812-the-origins-of-national-consciousness','Complete substantive publisher-hosted excerpt read, including closing limit: print-language reach does not map automatically onto state boundaries and the Americas require further explanation. Supports vernacular print markets, language fixity and hierarchies, and contingent convergence of capitalism, print and linguistic diversity. Not a reading of the complete book or a demonstration of a single necessary cause. Existing source anderson and its earlier opening-only/full-book-unread note are retained exactly; this separate source records the enlarged 2026-10-25 reading scope.',True)
